{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1067104-mages-in-the-hedge","id":1067104,"title":"Mages in the Hedge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-23T12:45:12-07:00","id":1067104,"title":"Mages in the Hedge","content":"How is magic affected in the Hedge if at all? I'm trying to find out in the books but don't see anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T12:48:26-07:00","id":1067109,"title":"","content":"In first edition I believe it was the same except you couldn't use it to teleport or otherwise escape. I believe you could use it to optimize chances to find an exit, though my memory on the matter is hazy at best.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T12:58:39-07:00","id":1067117,"title":"","content":"To elaborate a little bit on Nofather, it's covered in the changeling book talking about the true fae more in depth(their version of imperial mysteries basically). Basically when you enter the hedge you are agreeing to a contract that you will only exit the hedge in a proper manner. Teleportation out via space is not such a manner. Aside from that I believe the thorns don't count as what they seem like, so while it might be a bush along the trail life won't help, or sharp rocks don't get touched by matter. Otherwise magic works like normal. Just be careful of the thorns peeling away your soul(because you aren't a changeling, you loose your soul like a moral does) and your magic along with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11759-bonreu","name":"Bonreu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T09:24:29-07:00","id":1067636,"title":"","content":"I'm waiting for Changeling 2ed to come out just for this as well. I'll be watching this topic for updates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"use